# Run frame 0 with a Nyquist-frequency signal (alternating +1 / -1).
# The DFT places all energy at the last bin (bin 16 = kDFTBins - 1).
# The shader panics when the peak-refinement function tries to read the
# bin immediately to the right of the dominant bin — one past the array end.

entry main

